// back to between moves. Nothing licensed has this, and a chibi's square brace can't be retargeted into
// it. The legs bend with the bob, so the feet stay down. Ticks
// are 60 a second. Turns are degrees in the character's rest space, about each bone's own joint, X then
// Y then Z. The character faces +Z, with its left arm along +X at rest.
